    "work_id": "pta/pta0001/pta030/pta-lat1",
    "canonical_ref": "pta0001.pta030.2.s6",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ideo etiamsi in terris pax, laudis ejus splendor redundat in coelum, laudant eam coelestes angeli et dicunt:",
